DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The aaccppiissbbss driver supports the ACPI Smart Battery subsystem and provides
     information about the Smart Battery devices contained within it.  Battery
     status is updated every 30 seconds, as well as in response to events from
     the subsystem.  Battery status can be monitored using sysctl(8) or
     sensorsd(8).

